cane. Extreme winds, rising water levels and possible tornadoes are also on the radar.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Mexico: Court finds three men guilty of murder of Australian, US surfers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2d40019402f252eb4ff32868285b7f3d8bd1072ffc5b3a41d630a72337575a1e</id><updated>2026-10-10T06:04:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T02:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/mexico-court-finds-three-men-guilty-of-murder-of-australian-us-surfers/a-79624125--635522eb3b29.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/mexico-court-finds-three-men-guilty-of-murder-of-australian-us-surfers/a-79624125?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The 2024 murders of brothers Jake and Callum Robinson, along with their friend Carter Rhoad, shocked Mexico and drew international outrage.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump weighs livestream execution amid bipartisan backlash</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:294c94c1109cf253af4aee384ed006f5e9ca2ddf839df20943ff29a45d6930f7</id><updated>2026-10-10T06:04:53Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T01:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-weighs-livestream-execution-amid-bipartisan-backlash/a-79623920--91b5d9f7318c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-weighs-livestream-execution-amid-bipartisan-backlash/a-79623920?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump said he hasn't decided whether the execution of the Fort Hood shooter will be livestreamed, after the Pentagon announced it would do so. The plan has been criticized by both Republicans and Democrats.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump names new press secretary to succeed Karoline Leavitt</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:68b519a891ef80c0cd17ab34cc27ca8f1d5db151c11dc6d18d8cb929870f6578</id><updated>2026-10-10T06:04:57Z</updated><published